function fundingOptions(s,routes){const recommended=chooseScenario(routes,{...plan,route:'auto'});return [...routes].sort((a,b)=>Number(b.route===recommended.route)-Number(a.route===recommended.route)).map(r=>`<button data-route="${r.route}" class="route-choice ${s.route===r.route?'selected':''}"><span><strong>${r.title}${r.route===recommended.route?' · suggested starting point':''}</strong><small>${r.legs.map(l=>money(l.amount)+(l.owner==='personal'?' you':' company')).join(' + ')}</small><small>${r.shortfall>.01?money(r.shortfall)+' funding shortfall':money(r.forecast.totalTax)+' total scenario tax'}</small>${r.route===recommended.route?'<small>'+(!AU&&plan.type==='startup'&&plan.eis==='yes'?'Keeps the maximum modelled personal EIS amount available for review.':'Lowest modelled total tax among these funded routes, using your assumptions.')+'</small>':''}</span><span>${s.route===r.route?'✓':'→'}</span></button>`).join('')}
function fundingProjection(s){return scenarioMarkup(s,plan)+`<p class="error">${s.shortfall>.01?'Needs '+money(s.shortfall)+' more funding. Change the amount, route or source limits.':''}</p><button class="primary wide" id="flow-to-review" ${s.shortfall>.01?'disabled':''}>Review plan →</button>`}
